<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Libya Dev API</title>
    <style>
        body{font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;background:#0b1220;color:#e5edf8;margin:0}.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:72px 24px}.pill{display:inline-block;padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid #28405f;border-radius:999px;color:#91c7ff}h1{font-size:clamp(44px,8vw,82px);line-height:.95;margin:24px 0}p{font-size:20px;line-height:1.65;color:#aabbd0;max-width:760px}.links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px}a{color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:#15253a;border:1px solid #29445f}code{color:#9ce5d5}.features{margin-top:56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:14px}.card{padding:20px;border:1px solid #23384e;border-radius:14px;background:#0f1a2a}.card strong{display:block;margin-bottom:8px}</style>
</head>
<body><main class="wrap">
    <span class="pill">🇱🇾 Open developer infrastructure for Libya</span>
    <h1>Libya Dev API</h1>
    <p>One stable, documented API for Libya-specific developer primitives: locations, phone normalization, telecom metadata and more — usable from Laravel, Flutter, JavaScript, Python, Java, .NET, Swift or any HTTP client.</p>
    <div class="links"><a href="/docs">Interactive API Docs</a><a href="/openapi.json">OpenAPI JSON</a><a href="/api/v1/meta">API Meta</a></div>
    <section class="features"><div class="card"><strong>Locations</strong><span>141 municipalities + cities from the pinned Libya Locations release.</span></div><div class="card"><strong>Phone</strong><span>Normalize local and +218 formats with transparent prefix metadata.</span></div><div class="card"><strong>Telecom</strong><span>Operator prefixes with source provenance and verification strength.</span></div></section>
</main></body></html>
